{"type":"finding","severity":"major","fileName":"src/commands/land-check.ts","codegenInstructions":"Verify each finding against current code. Fix only still-valid issues, skip the rest with a brief reason, keep changes minimal, and validate.\n\nIn @src/commands/land-check.ts around lines 947 - 966, The function hasOpenNoReviewerGap currently returns false when the ledger entry for targetId (\"BANDIT-GAP-NO-REVIEWER-CONFIGURED\") is missing, which allows a declared gap to be treated as closed; change the early missing-gap branch in hasOpenNoReviewerGap so that if gap is null/undefined it returns declaredGapIds.includes(targetId) (i.e., treat a declared-but-missing ledger entry as an open gap); keep the subsequent checks for gap.status (\"resolved\"/\"replaced\") and the final disposition check as-is.","suggestions":[]}
